  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Islands Forum, Geneva: WTO and Trade and Environment Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports the Pacific Islands Forum Permanent Delegation to the World Trade Organization (WTO) in Geneva to provide agile and targeted policy and technical advice to Forum Island Country Members of the WTO. It is focussed on enhancing Pacific participation in the WTO and on emerging multilateral trade and environment priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
